      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A lightning talk about CCAPI2, an algorithm trading platform.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The presentation will create in fifteen minutes a full trade system, that will be backtested against a prerecorded market situation. The outcome of this trading day is then presented and quickly discussed.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;About CCAPI2:&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The CCAPI2 is an algorithm trading plattform. With CCAPI2, users can create automated trade systems for trading stocks, futures, commodities and other financial instruments. The project contains forums, documentation, a mailing list and proper release cycles. At this time, seven more or less active developers take care of the 150 downloads per month.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
